<title>USA: Natural Health names Brian Wolfson chairman.</title>
<headline>Natural Health names Brian Wolfson chairman.</headline>
<dateline>POMPANO BEACH, Fla. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natural Health Trends Corp said Wednesday it named Sir Brian Wolfson chairman of its board.</p>
<p>He replaces Neal Heller, who remains the company's chief executive.</p>
<p>The company said it named Sir Brian chairman in conjunction with its recent acquisition of Global Health Alternatives Inc, where he was formerly chairman and CEO.</p>
</text>
